                        "entry_id": "3d931760-8138-342b-b059-f66619105b46",
                        "glosses": [
                            "markant citaat, een nieuwswaardige melding, bestaande uit niet veel meer dan één of twee zinnen die gemakkelijk beklijft en die gevatheid toont"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c689c685-51c6-488b-913d-b1318744c881",
                                "sense_id": "49025735-2471-3e55-b4da-49aeedbbec17",
                                "text": "‘Ik heb geen leuke soundbite voor je’, zegt Thurman ‘Omdat ik geleerd heb dat als ik dingen zeg wanneer ik kwaad ben, ik spijt krijg van de manier waarop me ik me uitte. Daarom wacht, tot ik minder kwaad ben. En als ik er klaar voor ben, zal ik zeggen wat ik te zeggen heb.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c09717b-4e0e-4684-bf27-aea300910bc1",
                                "sense_id": "49025735-2471-3e55-b4da-49aeedbbec17",
                                "text": "ls het om politiek entertainment gaat, zijn Amerikaanse presidentsverkiezingen kampioen. Buitenlanders volgen de race om te bepalen wie het beste in staat is om de VS - en, tot zekere hoogte, de wereld - te leiden. Maar in Amerika regeert het entertainment en Amerikanen richten hun aandacht vooral op de opwinding: wie ziet er beter uit, wie heeft de beste soundbite, een 'authentiek' uiterlijk, etc."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cac80afb-b1c0-4082-aaa0-1a3a65fe6267",
                        "source_entry_id": "3d931760-8138-342b-b059-f66619105b46",
                        "source_sense_id": "18fbc410-a732-3892-9db8-215ff4537a5e",
                        "source_sense_description": "kort geluidsfragment",
                        "target_lang_word": "sound bite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sound bite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "389e8378-c28b-32d2-950c-66498443f3d5",
                                        "entry_id": "e2a1fc31-39c6-33d7-9731-6f3b7d62a82b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extract from a speech or interview used as edited into a news or other broadcast; an interview clip, especially seen as particularly expressive or pithy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "597d6fda-e9cd-4a30-a7e1-efc624ddc74b",
                                                "sense_id": "389e8378-c28b-32d2-950c-66498443f3d5",
                                                "text": "The dumbing down of America is most evident in the slow decay of substantive content in the enormously influential media, the 30-second sound bites (now down to 10 seconds or less), lowest common denominator programming, credulous presentations on pseudo-science and superstition, but especially a kind of celebration of ignorance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67f57072-7de9-38e0-aee8-97eed9735d3f",
                                        "entry_id": "e2a1fc31-39c6-33d7-9731-6f3b7d62a82b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A one-liner deliberately produced for this purpose; a statement specifically intended to be punchy and memorable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e1e8026-5fef-41f6-893a-6667ccb29390",
                                                "sense_id": "67f57072-7de9-38e0-aee8-97eed9735d3f",
                                                "text": "The ground offensive against Iraq ended after 100 hours, partly out of concern that American troops not occupy an Arab capital, partly because Arab allies feared the disintegration of Iraq and partly because a “100-hour war” made a good sound bite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "173da4d7-ad32-4e14-abf0-012843870c76",
                                                "sense_id": "67f57072-7de9-38e0-aee8-97eed9735d3f",
                                                "text": "President Obama disdains sound bites, and he does not have Bill Clinton’s talent for reducing the abstruse to aperçus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaa6bee1-7791-43da-abcd-9a05f9547d81",
                                                "sense_id": "67f57072-7de9-38e0-aee8-97eed9735d3f",
                                                "text": "However, he bemoaned the era of rehearsed soundbites and \"Prime Minister's Insult Time\", which he said have diminished parliament."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5df21358-12f2-3ab4-b78c-60ceb004e81b",
                                        "entry_id": "e2a1fc31-39c6-33d7-9731-6f3b7d62a82b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of sound clip."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
